{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TaoiaGKNdfQLcmqDwPo0Rw?scene=1&click_id=12","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:11.865802+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/TaoiaGKNdfQLcmqDwPo0Rw?scene=1&click_id=12","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>点击蓝字</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>关注我们</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>重庆大学大数据与软件学院2026年招收推荐免试攻读研究生（以下简称“推免生”），类型包括直接攻读博士学位研究生（以下简称“直博生”），推免硕士生（学术型硕士生和专业型硕士生）。现将推免预报名工作有关事项公布如下：</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/K6OQnXxWokYKZXPRIbLUhPEz1JALiaDmGVdZpjdVFnJm0hkhCibLmcILlO8X20iauzHMS0Sp3A88PzeHLh1IU9uxw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格的高校的2026届优秀本科生，手续完备，材料齐全。</span></p><p><span>2.在校期间政治思想表现好，品德优良，诚实守信，学风端正，身心健康，勤奋好学，遵纪守法，无考试作弊、学术不端及其他违纪违法犯罪受处分处罚记录。</span></p><p><span>3.思维敏捷，有较强的创新意识及综合分析问题和解决问题的能力。</span></p><p><span>4.本科阶段学习成绩、特别是专业成绩突出，学术研究兴趣浓厚，学业规划目标清晰。</span></p><p><span>5.符合我校当年招生章程和招生专业目录中规定的其他报考条件。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间：截止至2025年9月14日</span></strong></p><p><span>获得推免资格的学生请登录“重庆大学研究生招生服务系统”http://syk.cqu.edu.cn报名，如实填写各项信息并提交。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>考核安排</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.资格审核：我院将对推免生申请材料进行资格审核后向材料审核合格的推免生通过学校预推免系统发送通知，请提交材料的学生注意查收通知。</span></p><p><span>2.考核形式：考核采取线下现场综合面试方式，面试地点为重庆大学虎溪校区，请参加考核的推免生提前做好交通、住宿等相应准备。</span></p><p><span>3.考核时间及其他未尽事宜以学院推免考核实施细则（将于近期发布）规定为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>其他说明</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>其余未尽事宜，遵照学校相关规定执行，若国家和重庆大学有招生政策变化，我院将做相应调整。</span></p><p><strong><span>咨询电话：023-65678330</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>咨询邮箱：segrad@cqu.edu.cn</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>编辑</span></span><span><span><span>丨张文韬</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>来源丨大数据与软件学院</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"f58679d4a26533f31e74d2cbe8cf7dd07d253bdd281b98059a2d2fb1e88bb398","textLength":697,"sourceSha256":"1a277fdf13d95f396d